# 📊 6. PLUGINS EXPLAINED (VERY IMPORTANT)

---

## 🔐 6.1 Key Auth Plugin

### Purpose:

API Key protection

### Flow:

```text
Client → sends API key → Kong validates → allow/deny
```

---

## 🔑 6.2 JWT Plugin

### Purpose:

Token-based auth

### Flow:

```text
Client sends JWT → Kong verifies signature → allows request
```

---

## 🚦 6.3 Rate Limiting Plugin

### Purpose:

Protect backend

### Example:

```yaml
minute: 5
```

Means:

👉 only 5 requests/minute allowed

---

## 📊 6.4 Prometheus Plugin

### Purpose:

Expose metrics

### Output:

```text
kong_nginx_requests_total
kong_memory_usage
kong_latency
```

